17:     Rule
18:     Clear the canvas to the background. Copy the rectangles in left-to-right
19:     order, placing the first at the upper-left corner. After placing a rectangle
20:     of height h and width w, place the next rectangle h-1 rows lower and w-1
21:     columns to the right, so later rectangles overwrite the shared corner cell.
22: 
23:     Key insight
24:     The bottom arrangement is a horizontal list of rectangles; the output keeps
25:     the list order and rectangle shapes while converting the list into a compact
26:     diagonal chain of overlapping bounding-box corners.
27:     """
